            "content": "# Route optimization script v2\nimport json\n\ndef optimize(routes, drones, objective='min_time'):\n    assignments = []\n    for route in routes:\n        best = min((d for d in drones if d['status'] == 'available'), key=lambda d: d['max_range_km'], default=None)\n        if best:\n            assignments.append({'route_id': route['route_id'], 'drone_id': best['drone_id']})\n    return assignments\n",
